      <abstract>
        <para>
          Although the cluster automatically moves resources when necessary, you might want to move
          resources manually, either to a specific node or just away from the current node. For
          example, you might move resources to other nodes to distribute the workload more evenly
          across the cluster, or to help isolate and troubleshoot a hardware or software issue.
        </para>
